  "rationale": "Expose a generic bounded local maximization driver under alea::optimize with explicit objective measure/identity, complete policy, last valid free-coordinate candidate, stopping conditions and typed progress-preserving errors. Extract the existing target-independent inverse-BFGS action into math and reuse it from Pathfinder without changing its selection/resampling policies. No covariance, finite/global-MLE, sampler/default or compatibility guarantee is added.",
